*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/**
!src-tauri/**
!third_party/codex-0.150/**
!deploy/proxy/**
!deploy/remote-bundle/**

# Re-including `src-tauri/**` above also re-includes its local Cargo output.
# On developer machines this directory can be tens of gigabytes and makes
# Docker Desktop spend an hour uploading build context before compilation.
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/resources/remote/manifest.json
src-tauri/resources/remote/linux-amd64/
src-tauri/resources/remote/linux-arm64/
target/
artifacts/
node_modules/
dist/

# The prebuilt ARM64 proxy Dockerfile consumes this one release binary.
!target/aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu/release/vellum-proxy-daemon
